# The book "Kith Venom" lies on the far side of a table in Tenebrae (map
# 39), 103 from the Avatar. Near enough to read it where he stands, but a
# peasant at the table is in the way (as in the original, nothing solid may
# be between): a click to read it sends him round the table, on this floor
# (not upstairs, as a walk once did), and he reads it there
args: --map 39 --pos 15762,7942,48
do: t3;useat:29175;t90;where:1
expect: useat: walking to 29175
expect: reader open (book)
expect: where 1: 15538,7926,48
